lidays from Round Rock ISD!\u003C/strong> \u003Cbr>All district offices and campuses are closed Dec. 21–Jan. 2.  Staff return Jan. 5, 2026, and students return Jan. 6.\u003C/p>",{"url":85,"alt_text":85},"banner",{"id":6376,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":6377,"content":6378,"image":6379,"status":6,"style":6374,"display_location":1783,"featured":12},35142,[22,92,98,104,110,116,122,128,134,140,146,152,158,164,170,176,182,188,194,200,206,212,218,224,230,236,242,248,254,260,266,272,278,284,290,296,302,308,314,320,326,332,338,344,350,356,362,368,374,380,386,392,398,404,410,416],"\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>All Round Rock ISD classes and before- and after-school activities are canceled for Monday, Jan. 26. All schools and offices also will be closed. Learn more on our \u003C/span>\u003Ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.roundrockisd.org/page/inclement-weather-protocols\">\u003Cspan>Inclement Weather Protocols page\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003Cspan>.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"url":85,"alt_text":85},{"id":6381,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":6382,"content":6383,"image":6384,"status":6,"style":6374,"display_location":1783,"featured":12},36027,[22,92,98,104,110,116,122,128,134,140,146,152,158,164,170,176,182,188,194,200,206,212,218,224,230,236,242,248,254,260,266,272,278,284,290,296,302,308,314,320,326,332,338,344,350,356,362,368,374,380,386,392,398,404,410,416],"\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>All Round Rock ISD classes and before- and after-school activities are canceled for Tuesday, Jan. 27. All schools and offices also will be closed. Learn more on our \u003C/span>\u003Ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.roundrockisd.org/page/inclement-weather-protocols\">\u003Cspan>Inclement Weather Protocols page\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003Cspan>.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"url":85,"alt_text":85},{"id":6386,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":6387,"content":6